  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996 in Varginha, Brazil, where some say a strange creature was caught, a military policeman named Marco Chereze fell ill with an infection that lasted about 12 or 14 days, and he saw three or four doctors about what they took for sciatica, a kind of back pain. This comes from Ahmed Foratu, a witness at the hospital in Varginha, who says he saw it first-hand. Those who tell the wider story link Chereze's death to his contact with the creature."
}
